# [DD-13b.W23.1] AN INDENTED WHITESPACE-ONLY LINE INSIDE A PROSE REGION —
# the format's ONLY paragraph break (§1.6.1a candidate (6)).
#
# S0's BLANK is the EMPTY line and nothing else, so a whitespace-only line
# ends nothing and is BYTES inside a region. ASSERTING THE VALUE is what
# catches the failure mode: a reader that ended the region at this line
# still "accepts" the file — it just loses the second paragraph — so a
# verdict-only assertion would pass on exactly the reader this fixture
# exists to refuse.
description |
  first paragraph
  
  second paragraph

pattern a+
m "aaa" 0 3
